{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 08:16:12 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: council_agentkit_memory_decay_integration] Identified root cause of 4/6 test failures: test_session fixture is an async generator but tests expect session_id string. Session never gets opened, causing ValueError when store_memory requires open session. | error=ValueError: No open session found; file=tests/test_phase2_reconsolidation.py; issue=fixture_async_generator_not_yielded; reasoning={\"how\": \"Need to convert async generator fixture to proper async fixture using asyncio event loop or restructure to regular fixture with sync await wrapper\", \"what\": \"Fixture uses async def but doesn't properly manage async generator lifecycle. Tests receive <async_generator> object instead of session_id string.\", \"why\": \"Tests fail because session fixture never yields session_id\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_agentkit_memory_decay_integration/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T08:16:12.189062+00:00_94f1fc1e", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T08:16:12.189119+00:00"}
