{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 08:16:41 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: council_agentkit_memory_decay_integration] Analyzing fixture structure: conftest.py has proper open_session_fixture pattern. Phase2 test_session fixture structure looks correct (yields session_id after await open_session). Need to verify if pytest-asyncio is handling the fixture properly. | file=tests/test_phase2_reconsolidation.py; investigation=fixture_lifecycle; reasoning={\"how\": \"Will verify pytest-asyncio mode and fixture scope settings. May need to adjust fixture decorator or async handling.\", \"what\": \"Comparing working conftest.py open_session_fixture with phase2 test_session fixture. Both use async def + yield pattern.\", \"why\": \"Need to understand why async fixture isn't yielding session_id properly\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_agentkit_memory_decay_integration/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T08:16:41.405617+00:00_de06ac47", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T08:16:41.405649+00:00"}
