{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-14 08:22:21 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: council_agentkit_memory_decay_integration] Progress: 3/6 PASSED. Root cause identified: _apply_reconsolidation passing 'current_strength' parameter to apply_access_boost() which doesn't accept it. Error: 'apply_access_boost() got an unexpected keyword argument current_strength' | error=unexpected keyword argument 'current_strength'; file=council_mcp/tools/ask_base.py; line=939; reasoning={\"how\": \"Need to check apply_access_boost signature in AgentKit and fix the call to match actual API\", \"what\": \"_apply_reconsolidation calls apply_access_boost with current_strength parameter that doesn't exist in AgentKit API\", \"why\": \"Reconsolidation silently failing due to incorrect API usage\"}; tests_failing=3; tests_passing=3; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/council_agentkit_memory_decay_integration/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-14T08:22:21.235056+00:00_71e0bd42", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T08:22:21.235085+00:00"}
